                </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter w-full">
<div class="flex flex-col items-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 text-4xl mb-4" data-icon="precision_manufacturing">precision_manufacturing</span>
<h4 class="font-label-sm text-label-sm mb-2 uppercase">Precision</h4>
<div class="h-[1px] w-8 bg-on-tertiary-container mb-4"></div>
</div>
