<p class="text-on-surface-variant max-w-lg">We don't just move cargo; we move boundaries. Our technical accents—from AI-driven route optimization to real-time warehouse monitoring—ensure we are always ahead of the curve.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-8 flex gap-2">
<span class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container text-primary font-data-display text-data-display uppercase">Tech-First</span>
<span class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container text-primary font-data-display text-data-display uppercase">Data-Driven</span>
</div>
</div>
