<img alt="" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover grayscale transition-all duration-500 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:grayscale-0" data-alt="A side view of a large logistics truck driving on a modern highway at sunset. The lighting is dramatic and warm, with golden hues hitting the metallic surface of the truck. The style is professional and corporate, emphasizing speed and efficiency." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDF-uod47Cg1LNfSH76zmg6UKjQjQNe2W3-zuZkAMYgII1Igqtk5wXe38qlqzquLitPsMEM_zG60E2wmr9NRv-JP2EMRKkvVyoEfOPVtiMDPLJs1VH3RdMXmfrPeD52vrwvhOa9LrMIUgpwjcUG3eB8on4ExKViiwNRavhpaqppWc2mC_MRo2tvSKvG7YrlCRjSvgXy3QVhH2op3ubzQq1G8pdYHcR2A7Kn0kajXKQyGC7vRM38g0TYT1TuQszxYuE8W2r5oKaD09fQ"/>
